FATE recipes and reference outputs from FFmpeg, vendored unchanged for the #503 Oracle lane (criterion 4: our own
audio decoders).

Source: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/24e860f6d3c4f2ebae65ed7649e2a8860d512879/tests
Commit: 24e860f6d3c4f2ebae65ed7649e2a8860d512879 (the commit the #503 oracle page pins)

Files, each the file of the same path under tests/ at that commit:
  fate/aac.mak, fate/mp3.mak, fate/opus.mak, fate/vorbis.mak, fate/matroska.mak, fate/ogg-opus.mak,
  fate/ogg-vorbis.mak, fate/flac.mak, fate/alac.mak, fate/lossless-audio.mak, fate/caf.mak, fate/lavf-audio.mak,
  ref/fate/matroska-opus-remux, ref/fate/lossless-alac, ref/fate/caf-demux, ref/lavf/aiff, ref/lavf/wav, ref/lavf/caf

